{"4431470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gravedigger", "steam_appid": 4431470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravedigger</strong> is a cemetery management game where you take on the role of the busiest gravedigger in town. Accept jobs from local residents, dig graves, maintain the cemetery grounds, and when business slows down... find new clients on your own. After all, a true entrepreneur doesn't wait for opportunities—he creates them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tools, expand your business, and keep everything running smoothly so your cemetery never stays empty for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Own Cemetery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cemetery won't take care of itself. Clean up trash, wash tombstones, maintain the grounds, and keep your eternal residents satisfied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/30c79ebc3ed83c8217ec5e7cfd87a7f8.poster.avif?t=1788109272\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/30c79ebc3ed83c8217ec5e7cfd87a7f8.webm?t=1788109272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/30c79ebc3ed83c8217ec5e7cfd87a7f8.mp4?t=1788109272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop and Upgrade Your Equipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit local stores and stock up on everything a professional gravedigger needs. After all, nothing boosts morale quite like a brand-new shovel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/2206500cc691aea2bd66cbadf424d2ee.poster.avif?t=1788109272\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/2206500cc691aea2bd66cbadf424d2ee.webm?t=1788109272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/2206500cc691aea2bd66cbadf424d2ee.mp4?t=1788109272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig Graves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graves won't dig themselves. Grab your shovel and get to work on the most important part of your profession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/587ffa768f01e624e05cfb4e2616b698.poster.avif?t=1788109272\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/587ffa768f01e624e05cfb4e2616b698.webm?t=1788109272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/587ffa768f01e624e05cfb4e2616b698.mp4?t=1788109272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find &quot;New Clients&quot; Your Own Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is your neighborhood a little too peaceful? Take matters into your own hands and discover alternative ways to grow your client base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/2068ed443978b92626fb463a53d0a33d.poster.avif?t=1788109272\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/2068ed443978b92626fb463a53d0a33d.webm?t=1788109272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/2068ed443978b92626fb463a53d0a33d.mp4?t=1788109272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll Physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cremation System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Living</span> City</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shopping and Equipment Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cemetery Maintenance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business Expansion</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! My name is Mateusz. I've been working in the game industry for years and eventually decided to create my own project with the help of my friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I regularly share updates and new additions to the game, so be sure to follow my social media channels to stay informed about development progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creators</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: &quot;RetroFuture Clean&quot; Kevin MacLeod </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravedigger</strong> is a cemetery management game where you take on the role of the busiest gravedigger in town. Accept jobs from local residents, dig graves, maintain the cemetery grounds, and when business slows down... find new clients on your own. After all, a true entrepreneur doesn't wait for opportunities—he creates them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tools, expand your business, and keep everything running smoothly so your cemetery never stays empty for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Own Cemetery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cemetery won't take care of itself. Clean up 