tore_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/587ffa768f01e624e05cfb4e2616b698.poster.avif?t=1788109272\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/587ffa768f01e624e05cfb4e2616b698.webm?t=1788109272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/587ffa768f01e624e05cfb4e2616b698.mp4?t=1788109272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find &quot;New Clients&quot; Your Own Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is your neighborhood a little too peaceful? Take matters into your own hands and discover alternative ways to grow your client base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/2068ed443978b92626fb463a53d0a33d.poster.avif?t=1788109272\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/2068ed443978b92626fb463a53d0a33d.webm?t=1788109272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/extras/2068ed443978b92626fb463a53d0a33d.mp4?t=1788109272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll Physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cremation System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Living</span> City</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shopping and Equipment Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cemetery Maintenance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business Expansion</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! My name is Mateusz. I've been working in the game industry for years and eventually decided to create my own project with the help of my friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I regularly share updates and new additions to the game, so be sure to follow my social media channels to stay informed about development progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creators</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: &quot;RetroFuture Clean&quot; Kevin MacLeod </p>", "short_description": "Game is about a gravedigger and funeral home owner. Your goal is to grow business by taking care of the cemetery and its residents. Serve you customers, upgrade your tools, and expand your business. If customers run out, you can always look for them in other ways...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/7681423963781045badbd077e89e7817f0a52cba/header.jpg?t=1788109272", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/8c6b0faacfad77e8db308e45e0207f73d10c61af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788109272", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431470/8c6b0faacfad77e8db308e45e0207f73d10c61af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788109272", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 @ 2.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GTX 1060 or RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Lenrox Games"], "publishers": ["Lenrox Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linu